    {
      "source": "Exposes EclipseLink's persistence provider and EntityManager extension interface,\nand adapts <a href=\"AbstractJpaVendorAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.orm.jpa.vendor\"><code>AbstractJpaVendorAdapter</code></a>'s common configuration settings.\nNo support for the detection of annotated packages (through\n<a href=\"../persistenceunit/SmartPersistenceUnitInfo.html#getManagedPackages()\"><code>SmartPersistenceUnitInfo.getManagedPackages()</code></a>)\nsince EclipseLink doesn't use package-level metadata.",
      "translation": "暴露了 EclipseLink 的持久性提供程序和 EntityManager 扩展接口，并适配了 <a href=\"AbstractJpaVendorAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.orm.jpa.vendor\"><code>AbstractJpaVendorAdapter</code></a> 的通用配置设置。由于 EclipseLink 不使用包级元数据，因此不支持检测带注解的包（通过\n<a href=\"../persistenceunit/SmartPersistenceUnitInfo.html#getManagedPackages()\"><code>SmartPersistenceUnitInfo.getManagedPackages()</code></a>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../JpaVendorAdapter.html#getPersistenceProvider()\">JpaVendorAdapter</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../JpaVendorAdapter.html#getPersistenceProvider()\">JpaVendorAdapter</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the vendor-specific JpaDialect implementation for this\nprovider, or <code>null</code> if there is none.",
      "translation": "返回此提供者的特定于厂商的 JpaDialect 实现，如果没有则返回 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
